// AWS IAM S3Browser Templated S3 Bucket Policy Creation | T1059.009, T1078.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/aws/cloudtrail/aws_iam_s3browser_templated_s3_bucket_policy_creation.yml
eventSource:iam.amazonaws.com AND eventName:PutUserPolicy AND userAgent:*S3\ Browser* AND (requestParameters:*\"arn\:aws\:s3\:\:\:\<YOUR\-BUCKET\-NAME\>\/*\"* AND requestParameters:*\"s3\:GetObject\"* AND requestParameters:*\"Allow\"*)
